{"5028050":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Traffic Architect","steam_appid":5028050,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5133710],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traffic Architect is a road builder and traffic-management game. Build and transform the infrastructure network of a self-growing, fully simulated city, where every new building sends fresh trips onto your roads: people driving to work, trucks making deliveries.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every traffic jam has a cause. You provide the creative fix: a few more lanes, a retimed signal, an extra road link, or a whole new highway with an interchange where the crossing used to be. Build it and watch the traffic flow.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when more asphalt stops working, build a public transport network. A bus line with bus-only lanes, a rail link or a metro tunnel placed where people already travel fills up fast, and every rider is one less car in your junction. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/bd32c2f6905055ac102fa58054022681.poster.avif?t=1793728776\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/bd32c2f6905055ac102fa58054022681.webm?t=1793728776\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/bd32c2f6905055ac102fa58054022681.mp4?t=1793728776\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design the network<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade roads through 11 tiers, from gravel tracks to boulevards and multi-lane highways<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross rivers with bridges and mountains with tunnels in one simple move<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild a jammed crossing as a full interchange in one click: 3-way compact or trumpet where three meet, a compact or wide cloverleaf where two roads cross<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the flow with one-way streets, turn restrictions and per-junction rules, then tune the traffic lights phase by phase<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/ee84dfc26fe5870228d4b156afe56d0b.poster.avif?t=1793728776\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/ee84dfc26fe5870228d4b156afe56d0b.webm?t=1793728776\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/ee84dfc26fe5870228d4b156afe56d0b.mp4?t=1793728776\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Traffic simulated car by car<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every vehicle is simulated. Follow a single car across town and see the jam from inside it<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people using your network report back, a smooth run, a long wait or a detour twice the direct distance, and a congestion heat map shows where the network hurts<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over two dozen live metrics, from queued cars to transit share, each charted across the whole run so you can see what a new interchange did to the numbers<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/b5eb570843fdb9b4b72c3c173e4ed186.poster.avif?t=1793728776\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/b5eb570843fdb9b4b72c3c173e4ed186.webm?t=1793728776\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/b5eb570843fdb9b4b72c3c173e4ed186.mp4?t=1793728776\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Move beyond the car<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bus lines with routes and stops, plus bus lanes and bus-only roads so your buses don't sit in jams<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passenger rail and underground metro with stations, level crossings and tunnels. Passengers route across your entire network, bus, rail, metro, transfers included. Build connections, and people will use them<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freight rides the rails: dedicate lines, connect industry to demand, and the trucks come off your roads. Goods change trains at shared stations the same way passengers do<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/5f75cbd47633984bed78315ab808dc30.poster.avif?t=1793728776\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/5f75cbd47633984bed78315ab808dc30.webm?t=1793728776\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/5f75cbd47633984bed78315ab808dc30.mp4?t=1793728776\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build it your way<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traffic Challenges: puzzles where you build the interchanges by hand, one ramp at a time, then test whether enough cars get through<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative mode: place buildings yourself, no budget and no way to lose<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full map editor: sculpt terrain, rivers, mountains and lakes, then play real runs on your own maps and share them on Steam Workshop<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large maps up to 18x18 km, with dense downtown districts and suburban settlements<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/35adc802f9702bac56b9a3a5252a6f3f.poster.avif?t=1793728776\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/35adc802f9702bac56b9a3a5252a6f3f.webm?t=1793728776\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/35adc802f9702bac56b9a3a5252a6f3f.mp4?t=1793728776\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traffic Architect is a road builder and traffic-management game. Build and transform the infrastructure network of a self-growing, fully simulated city, where every new building sends fresh trips onto your roads: people driving to work, trucks making deliveries.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every traffic jam has a cause. You provide the creative fix: a few more lanes, a retimed signal, an extra road link, or a whole new highway with an interchange where the crossing used to be. Build it and watch the traffic flow.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when more asphalt stops working, build a public transport network. A bus line with bus-only lanes, a rail link or a metro tunnel placed where people already travel fills up fast, and every rider is one less car in your junction. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/bd32c2f6905055ac102fa58054022681.poster.avif?t=1793728776\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/bd32c2f6905055ac102fa58054022681.webm?t=1793728776\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/bd32c2f6905055ac102fa58054022681.mp4?t=1793728776\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design the network<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade roads through 11 tiers, from gravel tracks to boulevards and multi-lane highways<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross rivers with bridges and mountains with tunnels in one simple move<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild a jammed crossing as a full interchange in one click: 3-way compact or trumpet where three meet, a compact or wide cloverleaf where two roads cross<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the flow with one-way streets, turn restrictions and per-junction rules, then tune the traffic lights phase by phase<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/ee84dfc26fe5870228d4b156afe56d0b.poster.avif?t=1793728776\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/ee84dfc26fe5870228d4b156afe56d0b.webm?t=1793728776\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/ee84dfc26fe5870228d4b156afe56d0b.mp4?t=1793728776\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Traffic simulated car by car<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every vehicle is simulated. Follow a single car across town and see the jam from inside it<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people using your network report back, a smooth run, a long wait or a detour twice the direct distance, and a congestion heat map shows where the network hurts<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over two dozen live metrics, from queued cars to transit share, each charted across the whole run so you can see what a new interchange did to the numbers<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/b5eb570843fdb9b4b72c3c173e4ed186.poster.avif?t=1793728776\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/b5eb570843fdb9b4b72c3c173e4ed186.webm?t=1793728776\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/b5eb570843fdb9b4b72c3c173e4ed186.mp4?t=1793728776\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Move beyond the car<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bus lines with routes and stops, plus bus lanes and bus-only roads so your buses don't sit in jams<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passenger rail and underground metro with stations, level crossings and tunnels. Passengers route across your entire network, bus, rail, metro, transfers included. Build connections, and people will use them<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freight rides the rails: dedicate lines, connect industry to demand, and the trucks come off your roads. Goods change trains at shared stations the same way passengers do<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/5f75cbd47633984bed78315ab808dc30.poster.avif?t=1793728776\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/5f75cbd47633984bed78315ab808dc30.webm?t=1793728776\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/5f75cbd47633984bed78315ab808dc30.mp4?t=1793728776\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build it your way<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traffic Challenges: puzzles where you build the interchanges by hand, one ramp at a time, then test whether enough cars get through<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative mode: place buildings yourself, no budget and no way to lose<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full map editor: sculpt terrain, rivers, mountains and lakes, then play real runs on your own maps and share them on Steam Workshop<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large maps up to 18x18 km, with dense downtown districts and suburban settlements<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/35adc802f9702bac56b9a3a5252a6f3f.poster.avif?t=1793728776\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/35adc802f9702bac56b9a3a5252a6f3f.webm?t=1793728776\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/extras\/35adc802f9702bac56b9a3a5252a6f3f.mp4?t=1793728776\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Become the master of traffic with your expert infrastructure designs. Lay down streets, shape junctions, time traffic lights, design a public transport network, and watch the city come alive. It grows on its own, and every new building sends more trips onto the roads you built.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Bulgarian, Czech, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Ukrainian","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/72607a0ad3009de80f6df2ffcceb6f889fb5cd9a\/header.jpg?t=1793728776","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/2686e34a8054e65384b180d013b462cba588e708\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793728776","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5028050\/2686e34a8054e65384b180d013b462cba588e708\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793728776","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core 2.4 GHz (Intel Core i3 or equivalent)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4096 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Any GPU with WebGL 2.0 support (Intel HD 4000 or newer)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1000 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad-core 3.0 GHz (Intel Core i5 or equivalent)<br><\/li>